  "details": "I've seen other similar issue, but it was very old with no votes and this started to happen for me after 2018 unity update.\nBasically if I stay for long enough if given world without using my menu (like sleeping, a nap or something, not sure if other intractables can affect this) and then I try to open and close the menu (like social tab) - the moment I close it the game freezes. Freeze depends on how long you were not using it, so it can be few seconds or like 15+ minutes where I just often restart the game if it does not unfreeze in 1 minute.\nIts pretty annoying, especially if its not a world you can easily rejoin + you lose the state of world, so like drawings and stuff.\nIt even happens if you just play long enough in some world while being active but not opening the menu.",
